---
description: How to onboard a user of this repository from inside Cursor
alwaysApply: false
---

When the user asks to set up, onboard, configure, or connect this agent, follow the "Onboarding a
user" section of AGENTS.md. Start the console in a background terminal with
`uv run paid-media-agent setup --no-open --no-token --port 8765` and open http://127.0.0.1:8765
in Cursor's built-in browser so they can walk through Model, Ad accounts, Try it, and Where it
lives without leaving the editor. After credentials are in, fill organization context in this
chat (skill `paid-media-org-onboarding`) or with `paid-media-agent org interview` — not in the
console. Every console step shows the CLI command it runs; use those when the browser is
unavailable. Never ask for API keys or provider account ids in chat.
